Hey, I hear Patamon.

41
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,005
I wonder if he's found anyone.

42
00:03:10,580 --> 00:03:11,410
Oh.

43
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:14,240
Who's that with Patamon?

44
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,800
It's Beemon! And Sora!

45
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,460
Kari, you're awake!

46
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,380
You look so much better!

47
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:24,602
Have you seen Tai and the others?

48
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:25,710
Mm-mm.

49
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:29,540
I looked everywhere, but
couldn't find them. Tai!

50
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:30,980
Help me, Tai!

51
00:03:32,340 --> 00:03:33,170
Kari!

52
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,430
Kari!

53
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:41,799
My guess is that when we all fell,
Tai and Izzy landed somewhere else.

54
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:43,371
I hope they're all right.

55
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,740
Don't worry, Kari.

56
00:03:45,100 --> 00:03:46,320
Oh, I almost forgot.

57
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,973
Look what Biyomon found.

58
00:03:48,180 --> 00:03:51,180
I'm sure it's the medicine
Tai went to find for you.

59
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:53,677
Why don't you keep it in
case your fever comes back?

60
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:56,377
You can use it as a reminder
of how much Tai loves you.

61
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:58,797
This place has a lot of
twists and turns to it.

62
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:02,657
I'm sure if we all look together, we'll
have no problem finding the others.

63
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:03,570
Right!

64
00:04:03,653 --> 00:04:04,660
We'll work as a team!

65
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:08,677
Yeah, I'll try to be
strong enough to help, too.

66
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:11,054
After all, Tai would do the same for me.

67
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:15,237
This place is like a museum of the
famous sewer systems of the world.

68
00:04:15,320 --> 00:04:17,144
I'll pass on the other exhibit.

69
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,540
Too late for that.

70
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:22,950
Stop.

71
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,739
Listen, do you guys hear something?

72
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,440
Yeah, I can hear it now, too.

73
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:32,665
What do you think it could be?

74
00:04:32,820 --> 00:04:36,417
I don't know, but it sounds like
it's coming from over there.

75
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:37,500
Let's take a look

76
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:46,897
Make me sick didn't
have such a weakness to

77
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:48,757
sunlight We wouldn't
have to keep them working

78
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:50,797
underground to power machine or bond city

79
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:53,660
on fire about You deserve
to live in sewers.

80
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:56,448
Now get back to work
before I really get mad

81
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,692
He used to be so cuddly.

82
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:06,860
That's not Monzaemon TK,
that's Waru Monzaemon.

83
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:13,220
Monzaemon was sweet and cute, but Waru
Monzaemon is about as cuddly as a porcupine.

84
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:17,377
His bear claw will give you heartburn
along with his heartbreak attack.

85
00:05:17,460 --> 00:05:18,380
Big meanie.

86
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:21,565
He's torturing those
poor Numemon down there.

87
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:26,092
How can one kind of Puppet Digimon be
so nice while another can be so evil?

88
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:28,357
I've been too hard on you guys.

89
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,270
You need a break.

90
00:05:29,353 --> 00:05:30,257
Okay, break's over.

91
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:32,420
If we had... more power.

92
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,280
Hurry! What happened?

93
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:38,813
Did she get sick again?

94
00:05:45,980 --> 00:05:47,320
What's going on here?

95
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:49,000
Get back to work!

96
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,110
Huh?

97
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,260
The Dizzy Destin?

98
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,317
