101
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,170
Oh!

102
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,600
Kari! Kari!

103
00:06:20,180 --> 00:06:21,980
Gatomon, please leave me here.

104
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,537
I need to free the
Numemon from their chains.

105
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,679
Do you understand?

106
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:27,000
I guess so.

107
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,534
Catch us if you can, you big throw run!

108
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:32,780
I'll get you!

109
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,780
Come on, Digivolve to!

110
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,555
Hey, what's going on?

111
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:40,420
Come on, Digivolve to!

112
