Wait a second, I'm still me!

113
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:46,020
You guys must be low on energy!

114
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:47,592
What do we do now, Zora?

115
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:49,437
Running comes to mind!

116
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,350
I need it!

117
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:56,880
Duck!

118
00:06:58,020 --> 00:06:58,880
Bearclaw!

119
