121
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,374
Let's get out of here!

122
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:08,760
Wait!

123
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,180
Let me ahead!

124
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:12,690
Literally!

125
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:16,717
It's time to play!

126
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,720
