is happening to me!

128
00:07:21,140 --> 00:07:23,137
I've never been able to
fly this fast before!

129
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:24,050
Me too!

130
00:07:24,133 --> 00:07:26,640
Watch me go! Faster! Fast! Attack!

131
00:07:26,980 --> 00:07:28,777
I don't care what you're faster than,

132
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:32,389
as long as you're faster than
a gigantic rolling teddy bear!

133
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:35,020
Queen Kauri!

134
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:37,180
Queen Kauri!

135
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,320
Queen Kauri!

136
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:43,357
The Numemon!

137
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,577
Think you're...

138
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:45,660
their queen!

139
00:07:46,980 --> 00:07:48,220
Queen Kari!

140
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,500
Queen Kari!

141
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:56,010
Kari?

142
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,280
Queen Kari!

143
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,800
Queen Kari!

144
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:01,280
Queen Kari?

145
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,040
I'm back!

146
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:07,786
Hey, you Numavon, what
are you doing out here?

147
00:08:07,900 --> 00:08:09,782
Isn't it time for your flogging?

148
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:12,760
Don't just sit there, staring!

149
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:15,560
Get back to work! Hey!

150
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:18,780
Who cut your chains off? I did.

151
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,120
Got a problem?

152
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,360
Kari, no!

153
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,080
You're through!

154
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:27,257
Get off of me, you green blomph of sludge!

155
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:29,340
I'll beat the snuffing out of you!

156
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,620
No, Mammon. Oh... Kari!

157
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:35,526
You really think you
have a chance against me?

158
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,360
Come on, give it your best shot!

159
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,875
This is easier than swatting Digi-fly!

160
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:53,330
No!

161
00:08:53,413 --> 00:08:55,320
Where's that light coming from? Kari!

162
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:58,720
What's happening?

163
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:00,472
I'm surging with energy!

164
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:03,340
Quick, get me a sprouting post! Digimon!

165
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,040
Gatomon! Digimon!

166
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:09,290
Digimon!

167
00:09:09,373 --> 00:09:10,600
Into ultimate!

168
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:12,560
I'm Jeroboamon!

169
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:30,580
Oh, gagging up huh?

170
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:32,291
I'll put you to work too!

171
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,777
What do you think of that?

172
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:34,800
Meteor wave!

173
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,040
And the bait!

174
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:40,200
Celestial arrow!

175
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:41,850
No!

176
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,300
Back to keep them out!

177
00:09:49,540 --> 00:09:52,240
No more chains, Numu Manu.

178
00:09:54,180 --> 00:09:56,474
They're cute when they're not so slimy.

179
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,200
I love you, Queen Kari.

180
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,560
You're sweet.

181
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,200
That light again!

182
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:04,000
Look at it!

183
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:08,920
My light will guide us towards the others.

184
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,030
Don't look at me,

185
00:10:11,113 --> 00:10:12,657
but I think it's like
this nightlight I used

186
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:14,757
to have that guided me
towards the bathroom.

187
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,670
Oh.

188
00:10:15,753 --> 00:10:18,991
Well, Kari, I hope your light
doesn't run out of batteries.

189
00:10:20,420 --> 00:10:21,250
Hmm.

190
00:10:22,540 --> 00:10:24,920
I'll lead the way. Follow me.

191
00:10:29,660 --> 00:10:33,197
Well, you see, Lord Machine Drummond,
it's actually a pretty funny story.

192
00:10:33,280 --> 00:10:36,515
Stop stalling and tell me
what happened, Waru Monzaemon.

193
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:39,137
That is, while you are still able to talk.

194
00:10:39,220 --> 00:10:40,720
Yes, your metalness.

195
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:42,920
You see, I found the Digi-destin.

196
00:10:43,060 --> 00:10:44,413
They were in your area?

197
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,957
Yes, and I was going to
capture them for you,

198
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:49,097
too, but this one little
girl was really strong,

199
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:51,897
and then the new one were biting
me, and it was really bad.

200
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:52,810
Enough.

201
00:10:52,893 --> 00:10:56,745
If you thought that puny little girl was
tough, wait till I get through with you.

202
00:10:56,840 --> 00:11:00,457
Why didn't you alert me,
you stupid carnival prize?

203
00:11:00,540 --> 00:11:03,377
I wanted to tell you
sooner, but they wounded me.

204
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:06,277
Look at my owies and boo-boos.

205
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,420
I'm sorry.

206
00:11:07,620 --> 00:11:10,437
I should be more sympathetic
after your grueling battle.

207
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:13,932
Let me reward you for helping
me locate the Digidestined.

208
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:18,260
He shot my paw!

209
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:39,910
Kari!

210
00:11:40,180 --> 00:11:41,010
Kari!

211
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:42,680
Where are you?

212
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:49,831
Agumon, what are you doing
laying down at a time like this?

213
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:51,170
Sorry, Tai.

214
00:11:51,300 --> 00:11:52,476
I'll try to keep up.

215
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:55,217
You know, Tai, that's the
fifth time he's collapsed.

216
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:59,241
Call me crazy, but I think maybe
we should rest for a little while.

217
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,780
Kari! Please!

218
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:05,090
That's right.

219
00:12:05,173 --> 00:12:06,397
Just let our Digimon die.

220
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,310
Huh?

221
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:08,360
Oh, sorry, guys.

222
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:10,117
It's just a figure of speech.

223
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,800
I'm pretty tired too, Tai.

224
00:12:12,140 --> 00:12:13,260
Why don't we rest?

225
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:15,177
Then we can commence our search again.

226
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:16,917
Please don't provoke him, Izzy.

227
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:19,020
Don't you understand? Kari's sick.

228
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:20,380
We have to find her.

229
00:12:20,740 --> 00:12:23,446
I know that, Tai, but
she's not here right now.

230
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:24,840
That's my point.

231
00:12:25,060 --> 00:12:26,580
We have to find her now.

232
00:12:27,140 --> 00:12:28,060
Calm down, Tai.

233
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:29,477
I'm warning you, Tai.

234
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:31,972
You better stop giving us orders or else.

235
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,640
Or else what?

236
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,960
I didn't plan anything after or else.

237
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:39,577
I just thought it sounded tough.

238
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:40,954
You want to see tough?

239
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:41,960
Here's tough.

240
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:50,980
Izzy, did you hear that? Huh? Just
listen. Getting closer. Footsteps.

241
00:12:51,180 --> 00:12:52,917
All I hear is my head pounding.

242
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:53,882
Someone's here.

243
00:12:56,260 --> 00:12:58,117
You think he's been following us?

244
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,030
Maybe.

245
00:12:59,113 --> 00:13:01,177
Let's pretend to keep fighting
and we'll hide behind that gate.

246
00:13:01,260 --> 00:13:05,320
Okay, but just make sure your
next punch is pretend, too.

247
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:07,137
Better stop calling me names!

248
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:08,050
I will not!

249
00:13:08,133 --> 00:13:09,057
You're a bully and a...

250
00:13:09,140 --> 00:13:10,020
a ruffian!

251
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,357
That's the best you could come up with?

252
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,969
Yes, on such short notice.

253
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:26,137
Do you think it could be one
of Machinedramund's guys?

254
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,050
It's possible.

255
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:28,570
Should we?

256
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,110
Digivolve?

257
00:13:31,260 --> 00:13:32,090
Yes.

258
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,500
Not a bad idea.

259
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,140
Digimon! Digimon!

260
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:36,480
Digivolve too!

261
00:13:38,020 --> 00:13:39,480
Kaboom! Never mind!

262
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:41,410
Digimon!

263
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:42,820
Digivolve too!

264
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,090
Greymon!

265
00:13:46,180 --> 00:13:47,010
Greymon!

266
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:48,750
Greymon!

267
00:13:48,833 --> 00:13:49,777
Yeah, I'm Greymon!

268
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:50,937
I'm big and I'm big and I'm...

269
00:13:51,020 --> 00:13:53,800
Agumon, your Digivolve was a digi-dud.

270
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,844
Your energy levels are too low.

271
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,260
Izzy, I'm sorry.

272
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,640
It's okay, Tai.

273
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:02,157
I know your original
intention wasn't to punch me.

274
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,593
You were worried about Kari, that's all.

275
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,217
What's fair is fair.

276
00:14:08,300 --> 00:14:09,537
I want you to hit me right now.

277
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:10,537
That's ridiculous.

278
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:11,737
I won't resort to that.

279
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:13,177
Nothing can be settled with violence.

280
00:14:13,260 --> 00:14:14,497
I'm not gonna hit you, Tai.

281
00:14:14,580 --> 00:14:15,698
Can I hit you then?

282
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,822
I wouldn't mind to swipe myself.

283
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,390
Okay.

284
00:14:19,473 --> 00:14:20,303
I get it.

285
00:14:20,386 --> 00:14:21,216
Here he comes.

286
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:26,230
Andromon!

287
00:14:26,400 --> 00:14:27,480
I remember now!

288
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:30,117
We met Andromon on File Island He was the

289
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:32,457
android Digimon who had
a black gear stuck in his

290
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:35,017
mechanism But we removed
it and freed him of its

291
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:38,477
evil spell I wasn't sure
if it was you or not Well,

292
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:41,037
it's nice to see a
friendly face Even if it is

293
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:43,257
made of metal What are you
doing down here anyway,

294
00:14:43,340 --> 00:14:44,170
Andromon?

295
00:14:44,253 --> 00:14:45,517
And why are you sneaking up on people?

296
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:49,917
I'm trying to put together a
resistance army against Machinedramon

297
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:53,294
I've heard rumors that Digimon
are hiding in the sewers.

298
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:57,880
They fled here when
Machinedramon burned the cities.

299
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:01,140
I've come to the sewers to organize them.

300
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:04,900
And while I'm here, I'm
going to fix that drip.

301
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:10,880
I thought you were spies sent here
by Machinedramon to destroy my plans.

302
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,520
How insulting. I'm sorry.

303
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:16,497
We're looking for my
little sister named Kari.

304
00:15:16,580 --> 00:15:17,410
She's sick.

305
00:15:17,493 --> 00:15:18,323
Have you seen her?

306
00:15:18,406 --> 00:15:21,980
Sora, Biyomon, TK, and Panamon
are probably with her, too.

307
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:23,817
You mean...

308
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:26,800
Queen Kari is your sister? Queen?

309
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,118
Wait just a moment!

310
00:15:31,060 --> 00:15:32,000
They're coming!

311
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:36,840
Kari and the others are coming
here? When? Now! Really?

312
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,475
Prodigious, Andromon!

313
00:15:42,700 --> 00:15:43,720
Oh, good.

314
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,420
Just what I was looking for. Victims.

315
00:15:49,020 --> 00:15:50,980
Hello, Andromon. Babysitting?

316
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:53,987
I'll destroy you fast
while the others watch.

317
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:59,160
I'll hold him up. You hide. Careful!

318
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:08,990
Andromon!

319
00:16:11,860 --> 00:16:12,919
Andromon, hang on.

320
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,275
We're coming to help.

321
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:15,670
Huh?

322
00:16:15,753 --> 00:16:16,920
What is it, Kari?

323
00:16:17,180 --> 00:16:18,100
They're coming.

324
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:21,200
You mean Tai? When? Now.

325
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,940
Machine pod!

326
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:34,600
Tai, it's you! Kari!

327
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:38,640
Sora, TK!

328
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:42,330
Kari!

329
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:45,320
She made it.

330
00:16:45,580 --> 00:16:48,639
Was that Andromon I saw
fighting with Machinedramon?

331
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:50,074
That's him, all right.

332
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:53,140
He's sacrificing himself
to protect us. Oh!

333
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,837
He's raising an army
against Machinedramon.

334
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:56,750
Dragonfire!

335
00:17:06,380 --> 00:17:08,440
Are you all right, Andromon?

336
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:09,560
Yes, thank you.

337
00:17:09,740 --> 00:17:11,577
We'll take you to safety. No!

338
00:17:11,660 --> 00:17:13,940
Let's fight Machinedramon together!

339
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,940
Meteor wave!

340
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,000
Celestial arrow!

341
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:35,780
Machinedramon's a megadigimon!

342
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:36,922
They can't win!

343
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:42,490
No!

344
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,460
Now I've got you, Digi-Destin.

345
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:58,820
Who wants to be the first victim?

346
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:01,090
Kari!

347
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:11,240
How brave you are to volunteer.

348
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:14,700
I'll try to make this as painful as I can.

349
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:21,052
What do you think you are doing, Numemon?

350
00:18:22,380 --> 00:18:23,210
Numemon?

351
00:18:23,293 --> 00:18:25,453
Do you slimy Digimon call this fighting?

352
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:27,480
Numemon? You got it.

353
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:34,100
Oh, no, my mom!

354
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:37,430
Hurry!

355
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:40,520
I found the power!

356
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:43,360
Come on, more Pidgey Bombs!

357
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:47,668
Pidgey Bombs, Digital Monsters,
Pidgey Bombs are the jumpers!

358
00:18:48,220 --> 00:18:51,808
Pidgey Bombs, Digital Monsters,
Pidgey Bombs are the jumpers!

359
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:59,000
Warp, Pidgey Bombs!

360
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:02,340
Digimon!

361
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:04,200
Digital monsters! Digimon!

362
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:05,340
Darada champions!

363
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:09,180
War Kramer!

364
00:19:09,860 --> 00:19:13,560
Digimon! Digital monsters! Digimon! Grr!

365
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:15,980
Wake up!

366
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,510
Coralmon!

367
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,760
Now I will finish you once and for all.

368
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:39,460
I don't think so.

369
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:42,160
You missed what I did as Wargreymon.

370
00:19:42,580 --> 00:19:44,460
I sliced you like an onion.

371
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:10,200
Without Machinedramon, this
area has become unstable.

372
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:12,320
It's beginning to fall apart.

373
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:15,897
Nothing can happen to us that
we can't handle together.

374
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:16,810
Right.

375
00:20:16,893 --> 00:20:18,897
I think it's becoming
a little too dangerous.

376
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:20,509
We better get out of here.

377
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:22,420
You're right. Let's go.

378
00:20:28,220 --> 00:20:30,044
Ashindramon City is dissolving.

379
00:20:30,180 --> 00:20:31,800
My work here is finished.

380
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:33,958
Farewell, Andromon.

381
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:34,910
Thank you.

382
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:43,586
When we get down, can I build one of those
memorials to my friends, the Numemon?

383
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:44,630
Sure.

384
00:20:44,713 --> 00:20:46,760
We'll all help build it, right guys?

385
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:51,880
You're next, Piedmon!

386
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:46,150
Hatsha

387
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:50,257
Ima gozo tobi tatu

388
00:21:50,340 --> 00:21:54,557
youuki wo momete Kokoro

389
00:21:54,640 --> 00:22:01,497
no hame kirogete Mada
mi nu mirai e Ima kara

390
00:22:01,580 --> 00:22:07,817
ho kate shinai sora he mukate Mada haji

391
00:22:07,900 --> 00:22:10,857
mata bakari sa Yume e

392
00:22:10,940 --> 00:22:15,837
no voppukane La la la…

393
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:18,997
La la la…

394
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:22,697
La la la…

395
00:22:22,780 --> 00:22:25,460
La la la…

396
00:22:55,460 --> 00:22:57,780
This is the women's war, Lady Tailmon!

397
00:22:58,300 --> 00:23:00,240
Now, the game has evolved.
